(Each design pattern systematically names, explains, and evaluates an imp\ortant and recurring design in )Tj
0 -1.2 TD
(object-oriented systems. Our goal is to capture design experience in a f\orm that people can use effectively. )Tj
T*
(To this end we have documented some of the most important design pattern\s and present them as a catalog.)Tj
0 -2.557 TD
(Design patterns make it easier to reuse successful designs and architect\ures. Expressing proven techniques )Tj
0 -1.2 TD
(as design patterns makes them more accessible to developers of new syste\ms. Design patterns help you )Tj
T*
(choose design alternatives that make a system reusable and avoid alterna\tives that compromise reusability. )Tj
T*
(Design patterns can even improve the documentation and maintenance of ex\isting systems by furnishing an )Tj
