(Another feature of MVC is that views can be nested. For example, a contr\ol panel of buttons might be )Tj
T*
(implemented as a complex view containing nested button views. The user i\nterface for an object inspector )Tj
T*
(can consist of nested views that may be reused in a debugger. MVC suppor\ts nested views with the )Tj
T*
(CompositeView class, a subclass of View. CompositeView objects act just \like View objects; a composite )Tj
T*
(view can be used wherever a view can be used, but it also contains and m\anages nested views.)Tj
0 -2.557 TD
